<section class="soft-skills-section" id="soft-skills">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Professional & Soft Skills</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Beyond technical expertise, I bring proven leadership, communication, and execution abilities that drive real business impact in multidisciplinary environments.</p>

    <div class="soft-skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i></div>
        <h4>Problem Solving & Analytical Thinking</h4>
        <p>Transformed raw reservoir & production data into actionable insights that reduced lab testing dependency and improved forecasting accuracy (R² up to 0.97).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
        <h4>Leadership & Team Collaboration</h4>
        <p>Led 20+ professional events as Director of Internal Affairs (SPE UCSI), built 3 industry partnerships, and coordinated large-scale conferences as Deputy Logistics Director.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i></div>
        <h4>Communication & Data Storytelling</h4>
        <p>Delivered interactive Power BI dashboards and presented findings to stakeholders; increased customer retention by 15% through targeted communication strategies at ALTIBBI.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-bullhorn"></i></div>
        <h4>Client-Facing & Influence</h4>
        <p>Achieved 20% increase in membership activations and maintained 95% customer satisfaction through data-driven client segmentation and relationship management.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-chart-gantt"></i></div>
        <h4>Project Management & Execution</h4>
        <p>Managed annual student association budget with 30% transparency improvement; delivered end-to-end data projects from raw collection to executive reporting.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="icon-circle"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i></div>
        <h4>Adaptability & Continuous Learning</h4>
        <p>Successfully transitioned from core petroleum engineering to data analytics while completing IBM, Deloitte, and Coursera certifications in parallel with full-time work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

